    - target: {fileID: 4131733748807728804, guid: 9eb85e4633b7e44f89c50c1b5fbb9760, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Label-Body
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8383344148730722992, guid: 9eb85e4633b7e44f89c50c1b5fbb9760, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'The tutorial has not yet been added, so consider this the mini-version.


        Yes
        Chef! is a cozy kitchen mangement game where you can befriend you animal
        staff members, make amazing meals and customise your kitchen.  This screeen
        has the core buttons labelled.


        Need to know information:

        -
        Menu items require produce to make, in this demo you start with produce however
        you may ned to buy more as you progress

        - The game has two phases
        ''Closed'' which is when you can buy produce, unlock more menu items and
        hire, organise and talk to staff. ''Open'' is when customers enter the resturant
        and your staff get to work.


        See this version (1.02) feature list
        below:


        - Two unlockable staff members

        - One menu item

        -
        Ability to purchase produce

        - Ability to talk to staff memebers

        -
        3 different customer skins'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8383344148730722992, guid: 9eb85e4633b7e44f89c50c1b5fbb9760, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_margin.y
      value: -80.5524
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8383344148730722992, guid: 9eb85e4633b7e44f89c50c1b5fbb9760, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_VerticalAlignment
      value: 256
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
